  "number": "41",
  "title": "含二次根式的代数式的变形",
  "printed_title": "41. 含二次根式的代数式的变形",
  "start_page": 246,
  "start_printed": 240,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-56",
      "label": "图 56",
      "page": 252
    },
    {
      "id": "fig-57",
      "label": "图 57",
      "page": 252
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 17,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在我们讨论各种不同的题,解这种题时,需要把含二次根式的代数式变形.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 化简表示式$2.3\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{20}-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用从根号下面提出因数的方法可以使$\\sqrt{20}$变形:$\\sqrt{20}=\\sqrt{4\\times5}=2\\sqrt{5}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用关于分数的平方根的定理和分数的基本性质使$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}$变形:$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{1\\times\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{5}\\times\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{5}=0.2\\sqrt{5}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是$2.3\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{20}-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}=2.3\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{5}-0.2\\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{5}(2.3-2-0.2)=0.1\\sqrt{5}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 约分: $\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$\\sqrt{15}=\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}$, $3=(\\sqrt{3})^2$, 那么$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}+2\\sqrt{5}}{(\\sqrt{3})^2+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}(\\sqrt{3}+2)}{\\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{3}+2)}$ $=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{3}}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0246#9",
        "p0247#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把分子和分母同乘以$\\sqrt{3}$, 得:$\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{15}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是,$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{15}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 查平方根表求表示式$\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}+4}{\\sqrt{2}-1}$的近似值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们设法化简这个表示式. 把这个分式的分子和分母分解因式不能化简,因此用下面的方法来作: 把这个分式的分子和分母乘以这样一个式子,使得在分母里得到有理数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式$\\sqrt{2}+1$是这种因式当中最简单的一个.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上,$(\\sqrt{2}-1)(\\sqrt{2}+1)=(\\sqrt{2})^2-1^2=2-1=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是,$\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}+4}{\\sqrt{2}-1}=\\frac{(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)}{(\\sqrt{2}-1)(\\sqrt{2}+1)}=(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "作乘法计算后,得到:$(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)=3(\\sqrt{2})^2+4\\sqrt{2}+3\\sqrt{2}+4=3\\times2+7\\sqrt{2}+4=10+7\\sqrt{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "查表求出$\\sqrt{2}\\approx1.414$. 由此得:$10+7\\sqrt{2}\\approx10+7\\times1.414=19.898$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "4. 证明: 对于任何$a\\geq0$和$b\\geq0$, 不等式$\\sqrt{a+b}\\leq\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 241,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0247#11",
        "p0248#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "显然,对于任何$a\\geq0$和$b\\geq0$来说,$\\sqrt{a+b}$和$\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$的值是非负的. 我们来比较它们的平方的大小:$(\\sqrt{a+b})^2=a+b$;$(\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b})^2=(\\sqrt{a})^2+2\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}+(\\sqrt{b})^2=a+b+2\\sqrt{a}\\sqrt{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 242,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0248#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$2\\sqrt{a}\\sqrt{b}\\geq0$, 所以$(\\sqrt{a+b})^2\\leq(\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b})^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 242,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0248#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此 $\\sqrt{a+b}\\leq\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 242,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0248#4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
